From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:40:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the ASUS Zenbook 14 UX3480QA

The ASUS Zenbook 14 UX3480QA is the Zenbook A14's platform in another
chassis. Its tree names the board asus,zenbook-14-ux3480qa on
qcom,x1p42100. Add it to those boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index 8bd45e0..6b13dd0 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -1297,6 +1297,7 @@ properties:
               - acer,aspire-a16-11m
               - asus,proart-pz13-ht5306qa
               - asus,vivobook-s15-x1p4
+              - asus,zenbook-14-ux3480qa
               - hp,elitebook-6-g1q
               - hp,omnibook-5
               - hp,omnibook-x14-fe1
-- 
2.47.3

